WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.387
Small functions become powerful when we combine them.

00:00:03.387 --> 00:00:06.187
The first function calculates profit.

00:00:06.187 --> 00:00:12.517
With sales of fifteen hundred and costs of ten fifty, profit is four hundred fifty.

00:00:12.517 --> 00:00:18.282
The second function receives that profit and divides it by sales to calculate margin.

00:00:18.282 --> 00:00:22.588
Four hundred fifty divided by fifteen hundred gives thirty percent.

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:29.327
This is function composition: one small result becomes the input to another small function.

00:00:29.327 --> 00:00:34.826
Keeping each function focused on one job makes testing and reuse easier.
